Path: crates/franken-node/tests/fleet_cli_e2e.rs
Fix: Add TestLogger infrastructure with phase tracking, timing capture, and transport state snapshots between reservation → publish_action → reconcile → release phases

Constant-time validation bypassed in validate_capabilities function:

```rust
for valid_cap in VALID_CAPABILITIES {
    if ct_eq(capability, valid_cap) {
        is_valid = true;
        break;  // <-- TIMING ATTACK: early exit leaks position
    }
}
```

